>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したばかりだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ve just oiled the wheels.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さすが</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不愧是；果然；正如所料；还是；终究；毕竟；连…都；即使…也</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216826\">さすが、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>期待<rp>(</rp><rt>きたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>裏切<rp>(</rp><rt>うらぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らないね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That&#x27;s just what one would expect of him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さっさと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迅速；立即；毫不拖延；急匆匆地；急忙地；冷淡地；漠然地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216786\">さっさと<ruby>宿題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Do your homework without delay.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">早速</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さっそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">立即；马上；迅速</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91568\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はベストセラーの<ruby>小説<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>早速<rp>(</rp><rt>さっそく</rt><rp>)</rp